{"hw":"ἄθεος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἄθεος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἄθεος</span> (A), <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">without God, denying the gods</b>, esp. those recognized by the state, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">26c</span> </span>, etc.: applied to Diagoras, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Cic.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">ND</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.23.63</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">παράδειγμα ἄ.</span>, opp. <span class=\"gk\">θεῖον</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tht.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">176e</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> generally, <b class=\"lex-tr\">godless, ungodly</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">P.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.162</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Eu.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">151</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1036</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Comp.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">-ώτερος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.32</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Sup.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">-ώτατος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">An.</cite> <span cla